            <dt>Risk to remote</dt><dd class=3D"risk"><i class=3D"pip on"><=
/i><i class=3D"pip on"></i><i class=3D"pip"></i><i class=3D"pip"></i><i cla=
ss=3D"pip"></i><small>low, read first</small></dd>
          </dl>
        </article>

        <article class=3D"card rec">
          <span class=3D"tag">B =C2=B7 Export</span>
          <h3>Account export</h3>
          <p>A one-time export of everything your account holds: devices wi=
th their IR commands, activities, button maps and sequences, saved as JSON.=
</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Replays the app's own SOAP calls with your signed-in sessio=
n</li>
            <li>Keeps your data usable after the servers close</li>
            <li>Feeds the device library in proposal C</li>
          </ul>
          <dl class=3D"scores">
            <dt>Feasibility</dt><dd><i class=3D"pip on"></i><i class=3D"pip=
